Godot Engine v4.7.2.stable.official.ed1daf0bf - https://godotengine.org

PASS for_station: right panel for every station (21 base + those added by data files), suit rack included
PASS power panel has a switch for every zone
PASS switch Greenhouse off sends exactly one set_zone_power with the right zone and value
PASS load text updates after Greenhouse off
PASS cause and effect sentence for Greenhouse
PASS switch Hangar bay off sends exactly one set_zone_power with the right zone and value
PASS load text updates after Hangar bay off
PASS cause and effect sentence for Hangar bay
PASS refused switch: one request, host answers too_far
PASS refused switch flips back and shows the reason
PASS switch reflects the state on refresh
PASS computer buttons open Colony summary, Upgrades and Blueprint
PASS station readings show values with units, a status mark and a ? button
PASS upgrade cards load into UpgradeDefinition (16 + 4 radio cards, all five sectors)
PASS cards show cost vs parts, the locked reason, and a disabled install button
PASS locked reasons in words: sector level, questions to answer, things to do
PASS keyboard focus moves between the cards
PASS blueprint draws without errors
PASS blueprint converts coordinates (room centre within 1 px, west left, north up)
PASS blueprint shows an unpowered room dimmed with ✖
PASS clicking a room shows its name, power state and load
PASS legend lists every symbol used
PASS zoom doubles the plan and Centre on me puts you in the middle
